# Take or release manual control of this gateway's drive targets (docs/architecture.md "Who is
# in control"). While held by someone, /cmd_vel (autonomy) is ignored; /cmd/drive (the manual/
# teleop channel) always goes through. Only one holder at a time; release with the same holder id.
string holder   # caller-chosen id, e.g. "dashboard" or "teleop"; required
bool release    # false = take, true = release
---
bool success
string message
bool holding    # true if `holder` holds control after this call
